  "description": "Na-Rin prepared an event to spend her birthday with her boyfriend. However, her boyfriend broke up with her on the same day and Na-Rin was left alone at the hotel she had booked. Na-Rin, who did not want to be alone on her birthday, looked through SNS to find someone to meet and then came across her childhood friend Han-Gyeol, who she had lost contact with after confessing to her. Wanting to meet again after a long time, Na-Rin impulsively contacts Han-Gyeol…\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of the 2024 Post Type GL Winter Anthology (\\[GL\\] 2024 포스타입 앤솔로지 | 겨울).*",
